// VirtualMachineBackup is the Schema for the VirtualMachineBackups API. Turns on the paid backup add-on for a virtual machine. The platform then takes backups on its schedule, starting with one right away; list them with data.noderings_virtual_machine_backups. Only platforms with the on_demand_backup capability (Proxmox) support backups. Billing: the add-on is charged on the VM's subscription. Destroying this resource cancels the add-on immediately and deletes all of the VM's backups. Reinstalling the VM also cancels it. If the add-on is already active when this resource is created, it is adopted without enabling it again.
